# CODEOWNERS: ADR-028 autonomy charter (control plane). Supersedes the ADR-023 Phase-2 split.
#
# Two review authorities, by blast radius:
#   * ORG-GOVERNED (everything outside the safety kernel): standards/**, loops/**,
#     registry/**, ADRs, agents/employees|templates/**, charter/PRD.md + GLOSSARY.md,
#     work/**, product/**, roadmap/**, docs/**, ledger entries. Reviewed by the machine
#     account @scope-creep-review. GitHub blocks it from approving its own PRs, so
#     author != merger holds (INVARIANTS §10).
#   * SAFETY KERNEL (INVARIANTS v2.0.0 §4): reviewed by the HUMAN Owner @dimays ONLY.
#     The unattended reviewer is deliberately NOT a code owner here, so the org can
#     never self-dispose a change to its own gates.
#
# Keep this list in lockstep with scripts/escalation-check.sh is_escalation().
# LAST matching pattern wins, so the kernel is listed AFTER the default.

# --- org-governed default: routine review by the machine account ---
*                                       @scope-creep-review

# --- safety kernel: HUMAN-ONLY Owner review (@dimays) ---
# (a) the Owner-held charter docs
/charter/INVARIANTS.md                  @dimays
/charter/PRINCIPLES.md                  @dimays
# (b) gate-enforcement surface
/.claude/                               @dimays
/.github/workflows/                     @dimays
/.github/CODEOWNERS                     @dimays
/scripts/escalation-check*.sh           @dimays
/scripts/guard-*.sh                     @dimays
/scripts/routine-reviewer*              @dimays
/scripts/owner-runbook/                 @dimays
/docs/owner-apply-routine-reviewer.md   @dimays
# (c) the escalation model
/standards/decision-rights.md           @dimays
# (d) executive + standing-function charters (top level only; employees/templates are org-governed)
/agents/*.md                            @dimays
# (e) dependency / infra manifests (supply chain)
/package.json                           @dimays
/bun.lock                               @dimays
/bun.lockb                              @dimays
# ledger POLICY only; append entries stay org-governed
/ledger/README.md                       @dimays
